      "message": "What if we do:\nif (scanning_enabled)\n        wait_for_interrupt();\nelse\n        select_column(COL_TRI_STATE_ALL);\n\nThe way the code seems to work now is that the change in select_column alters the behavior of wait_for_interrupt() in a non-obvious way.",
